exports[`folded-more-indented.md - {"proseWrap":"always"} format 1`] = `
====================================options=====================================
parsers: ["markdown"]
proseWrap: "always"
                                                      printWidth: 80 (default) |
=====================================input======================================
---
description: >
  Ordinary text can be wrapped safely across multiple lines when it is long enough to exceed the print width.
    This more-indented line must stay intact even when it exceeds the configured print width of eighty columns.
  Ordinary text after the indented section can once again be wrapped safely when it is long enough.
---

# Heading

=====================================output=====================================
---
description: >
  Ordinary text can be wrapped safely across multiple lines when it is long
  enough to exceed the print width.
    This more-indented line must stay intact even when it exceeds the configured print width of eighty columns.
  Ordinary text after the indented section can once again be wrapped safely when
  it is long enough.
---

# Heading

================================================================================
`;

